<title>SINGAPORE: Heshe sees 41 mln shares crossed.</title>
<headline>Heshe sees 41 mln shares crossed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fashion retailer Heshe Holdings Ltd saw 40.99 million shares crossed at Singapore $0.30 each on Tuesday afternoon, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 0710 GMT, the shares were trading around S$0.345, up a cent, on over 41.3 million shares traded.</p>
<p>Dealers said they were unaware of any corporate developments or if any of the company directors were involved in the crossed trade.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
